+        "Track B: Section 3, Algorithm 1 enumerates lattice splits in a bounded "
+        "triangle, with cost polynomial in ||u|| (pseudo-polynomial in the input "
+        "bitlength); across eight shipping instances the measured reference scan "
+        "examined 6.89 million splits and 140.3 million counted exact operations "
+        "in 8.02 seconds on average, whereas central pairing took at most 165 "
