codex
The audit found a real weakness in the draft: it printed the two slope-extreme points, and because every pair had the same center, simply normalizing their sum and difference recovered the witness immediately. I’m removing that leak and varying pair centers while preserving the paper’s cone objects; the compact route will still exist, but it will require recognizing the hidden coordinate-swap symmetry and identifying the exact slope extremes.
apply patch
